<DocsPageTitle Path="Components/ContextMenu" AddedVersion="Added in v2.3">
    Blazorise ContextMenu component
</DocsPageTitle>

<DocsPageLead>
    Show contextual actions when a user right-clicks a target element or when application code opens the menu.
</DocsPageLead>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    The <Code Tag>ContextMenu</Code> component uses the shared document observer to listen for right-click events on a toggle or target selector.
    Use <Code Tag>ContextMenuBody</Code> for the menu surface and <Code Tag>ContextMenuItem</Code>, <Code Tag>ContextMenuDivider</Code>, <Code Tag>ContextMenuHeader</Code>, and <Code Tag>ContextMenuSubmenu</Code> for commands.
</DocsPageParagraph>

